00:47:32.060 --> 00:47:36.780
You really played out that your head was sort of tugged in a different direction as you
转过头的时候。

951
00:47:36.780 --> 00:47:37.820
were moving the other way.
朝反方向移动着。

952
00:47:38.740 --> 00:47:39.700
