967
00:48:38.180 --> 00:48:41.400
meetings went down about what you would look like.
开了多少次会。

968
00:48:42.200 --> 00:48:43.300
Oh, Emily.
哦，艾米莉。

969
00:48:43.960 --> 00:48:45.120
So many things.
太多地方了。

970
00:48:45.640 --> 00:48:46.740
So many meetings, Emily.
开了好多次会，艾米莉。

971
00:48:46.940 --> 00:48:47.420
So many.
多得数不清。

972
00:48:47.540 --> 00:48:48.340
So many.
真的超多。

973
00:48:48.620 --> 00:48:56.660
So originally, Alicia Raycraft, our wardrobe designer and I, we had a little meeting and
所以最初，我们的服装设计师艾莉西亚·雷克拉夫和我开了个小会，

