we were going to have her design Pam a wedding dress because Alicia is an amazing designer.
我们本来打算让她为潘设计一件婚纱，因为艾莉西亚是一位出色的设计师。

975
00:49:04.700 --> 00:49:09.920
But then we realized that Pam could never afford a custom wedding dress.
但后来我们意识到潘根本买不起定制婚纱。

976
00:49:10.780 --> 00:49:17.540
