00:49:54.360 --> 00:49:56.140
Tool or whatever in the front.
就是前面有网纱之类的东西。

989
00:49:56.380 --> 00:49:56.430
Yeah, yeah.
对，对。

990
00:49:56.440 --> 00:49:58.920
Like fabric to hide what you need to hide.
就像用来遮挡需要遮挡的地方的布料。

991
00:49:59.140 --> 00:49:59.320
Yeah.
对。

992
00:49:59.560 --> 00:50:00.880
We were like, this is perfect.
我们当时就觉得，这太完美了。

993
00:50:01.060 --> 00:50:04.340
I tried the dresses on with my little pregnancy bump belly.
我戴着我的假孕肚试穿了这些婚纱。

