别开玩笑了。

1000
00:50:28.040 --> 00:50:28.360
Yeah.
对。

1001
00:50:28.600 --> 00:50:34.900
And this woman was selling jewelry and I loved this necklace and it was made out of these crystals
然后这个女人在卖珠宝，我好喜欢这条项链，它是用这种水晶做的

