好了，我们回来了。

1015
00:51:23.120 --> 00:51:28.940
And Pam calls Jim on the phone and she's like, will you come meet me in my dressing room?
然后潘给吉姆打电话，她说，你能来我的化妆间见我吗？

1016
00:51:29.020 --> 00:51:31.180
