00:51:50.320 --> 00:51:51.600
Do you want to hear it?
你想听听吗？

1026
00:51:51.860 --> 00:51:56.160
Is it because there were arranged marriages and they didn't want guys to bail if they didn't
是不是因为以前有包办婚姻，他们不想让男人发现对方不好看就

1027
00:51:56.160 --> 00:51:57.200
find the person attractive?
临阵脱逃？

1028
00:51:57.580 --> 00:51:59.240
That's 100 percent right.
完全正确。

1029
00:51:59.420 --> 00:52:00.360
That was just a guess.
我只是随便猜的。

1030
00:52:00.880 --> 00:52:01.320
Yes.
是的。

1031
00:52:01.500 --> 00:52:03.920
I think that's also why women had to wear a veil.
我觉得这也是为什么女性必须要戴面纱。

1032
00:52:04.520 --> 00:52:05.080
Yes.
是的。

1033
00:52:05.920 --> 00:52:09.920
And that's why you didn't lift the veil until after they said you were married.
这就是为什么直到宣布你们结婚后，你才能掀开面纱。

1034
00:52:10.780 --> 00:52:14.820
OK, they also like made up the whole like, you know what?
好吧，他们还编造了整套说辞，你知道吗？

1035
00:52:14.980 --> 00:52:15.680
We got it.
我们懂了。

1036
00:52:15.800 --> 00:52:16.260
We got it.
我们懂了。

1037
00:52:16.400 --> 00:52:19.600
It's bad luck to see her before the wedding.
婚礼前见到新娘会带来霉运。

1038
00:52:19.820 --> 00:52:20.860
It's bad luck.
会倒霉的。

1039
00:52:21.440 --> 00:52:23.940
It was just like it's totally made up.
这纯粹就是瞎编出来的。

1040
